(text "F1 -> Q1 drain; Q1 source -> protected 12V_FUSED bus. P-MOS body diode points input to load." (at 15 15.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 18001b5e-0c8f-5aab-b3ac-f8b60b1e5142)) (text "D1 cathode (band/pad1) to source; anode to gate. R2 10k from gate to GND." (at 15 18.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 73d89591-a0aa-5699-8378-5306da7aa592)) (text "IRF4905PbF: -55V, 20mOhm max at VGS=-10V, -74A case rating. TO-220 pin1 G,2 D/tab,3 S." (at 15 22.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4c625ccb-1624-5319-b9fa-1e512881a4bb)) (text "At 12A: 2.88W at 20mOhm, more when hot. Heat sink / assembly thermal verification required." (at 15 25.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e9f31e38-2f16-5f46-87c3-d71e81e99fdd)) (text "Single MOSFET is reverse-input protection, not reverse-current or load-disconnect protection." (at 15 29.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 14d5d330-9336-5a01-bdbe-df647ca7c6db)) )
